{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "47bb9c50dae7a057da23083916706845b65bf7bc249953faed34a4b5f5f2eaf7", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影だ。\n春香は『猫と癒やしのひと時』というテーマに挑む）", "zh": "（今天是角色扮演写真企划的拍摄。\n春香要挑战“与猫咪共度治愈时光”这一主题。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9644ec636403b3e2330ea3380ec677dae18e5b8b12526429c9c44da31074dfff", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n共演するネコちゃん達って、もう来てるんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n一起拍的猫咪们已经到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "96749ee1f291fcb4af3ced095bb8f914ba2bdffc30ec3897a11cf6218e4e0428", "ja": "ああ。現場の雰囲気に慣れてもらうために\n早めに入ったって。", "zh": "嗯。为了让它们适应现场的氛围，已经提前过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "020b91d0adee19ce45b1c40ebbd70e6835df175aa57dc08d6857c1ccf97786d4", "ja": "そうなんですね！　その、ネコちゃん用のおやつを\n作ってきたんで、渡しに行きたいんですけど……。", "zh": "原来如此！那个，我做了些给小猫的零食，想拿去交给它……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1004_p", "source_sha256": "948df1defc27caaf9a6ea38f2e765777473db0b3cc50a598c77d8e9d007774fc", "ja": "いいじゃないか！\nそれにしても、猫のおやつって作れるんだな？", "zh": "这不是挺好的吗！\n话说回来，原来猫咪的零食也能自己做啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "6f97236ecf35ae2ea62d00d40d0d56e428b47c00073eb2f710abd42a945b400a", "ja": "はい。ネコちゃんと仲良くなる方法を調べてたら、\n偶然クッキーのレシピを見つけて。これだ！って。", "zh": "是的。我在查找和猫咪搞好关系的方法时，\n偶然发现了曲奇的食谱。就是这个！想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "89d5aa2457e794ff9b10f2895fb763805dd359c0600aa9552f1fbd5f5c49c12e", "ja": "この前、こぶんちゃんに味見してもらったら、\nとっても喜んでました。だから、味はバッチリです！", "zh": "前几天让小弟弟帮忙尝了尝，  \n他特别开心。所以味道肯定没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9fca09e86760691d5f1f89273c94d55ce9a634cabf8c030d4ba52f48bacbe06e", "ja": "こぶんって環がお世話してる猫だな。\n同じ猫のお墨付きなら、喜んでくれるかもな。", "zh": "小弟就是环照顾的那只猫吧。既然得到了同一只猫的认可，说不定它会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "d24b58cda7a8af0cc6fe058e57c3c37bc7f0c0ea589811c48dd85e5a18fba7d9", "ja": "えへへ。本当はじっくり仲良くなりたいんですけど……\n今日は、そんな時間はありませんから。", "zh": "嘿嘿。其实我很想慢慢和它培养感情……不过今天没有那么多时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "158f10a51023421401c8dcdca2c5d5a6d58613a30d7f26c2aa7d70311312cfdd", "ja": "ちょっとズルいですけど、手作りおやつで\n私のこと、いい奴かも？って思ってもらいたくて。", "zh": "虽然有点狡猾，但我想用亲手做的小点心，让它觉得我或许是个不错的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6c0c9dcdd27e65f3c9663c1c7fbc6e3ff2e2cb3371e75a26be905262c21c7362", "ja": "大丈夫、春香の思いは通じるよ。\n猫は、人の気持ちがわかるって聞くしな。", "zh": "没事的，春香的心意一定能传达到。\n而且我听说，猫是能明白人的心思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "af6bed93e63e8eb3af970134aba58e75457a61e53422987c0f780649b4a19497", "ja": "私の仲良くなりたいって気持ち、伝わるといいなぁ。\n美味しいクッキーを食べたら……あっ。", "zh": "希望我想和它成为好朋友的心情，能够传达给它就好了呢。\n吃了美味的饼干之后……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "b7301af28be15db09996c8c7fdca819f55a60cc869a3a2647e1086735d371986", "ja": "忘れるところでした！　{$P$}さんの\n分のクッキーも焼いてきたんです。あとで渡しますね♪", "zh": "我差点忘了！还烤了{$P$}先生那份曲奇。待会儿给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b76347afc998ef4c88c42ec6365ff6fc82c60b64702d4addb313f2fe03de83a1", "ja": "俺の……猫用クッキー？", "zh": "我的……猫咪饼干？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "68918839fb39931b1c51cf329a0d63746c006074e151e8ca89968bf9359e95e3", "ja": "ち、違います！　人間用のクッキーです！\nたしかに、ネコちゃんの形はしてますけど……。", "zh": "不、不是！这是给人吃的曲奇！\n虽然确实是猫咪形状的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e22db37a5b978adb6a2e6dfae299e453c66099e0801bf15d150f3ba858b7a1c", "ja": "ははっ、冗談だよ。ありがとう！　ところで春香、\n差し入れを渡すならもう行った方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "哈哈，开个玩笑而已。谢谢！话说回来，春香，要送慰问品的话，是不是该出发了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "cfb81a68e199fb885512bbdf5ba76b6637917616b6a1f47a975342d06384517b", "ja": "わっ、そうですね！　どんなネコちゃんが\nいるんだろう……楽しみだな～♪　えへへ。", "zh": "哇，说得也是！会有怎样的小猫咪呢……真期待啊～♪　嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0463_1017_p", "source_sha256": "882e1e73f83cb620a70e9c602d6908cada7450e4f979895d477e7b0bcee1f404", "ja": "（本番がはじまると、春香と猫達の仲の良い姿が\nたくさん撮れた。恐るべし、春香のおやつ効果……！）", "zh": "（正式演出开始后，拍下了好多春香和猫咪们亲密相处的画面。真不愧是春香的零食效果……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
